              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ido kobala Kuram ebe, “Kituritete EJAKAIT, Edeke loka Isirael, lokesubi akuj ka akwap, loabu koinak Daudi ekabaka okoku lokacoa, loejaas kacobeu ka ajenun, loekot adukokin EJAKAIT etogo, ka etogo loka ajakanutuke.",
          "type": "text",
